-ad ad-overlay" data-v-3c01027c><div id="div-gpt-ad-1621932966406-0"></div><!----></div></aside><div data-v-3dfc3020 data-v-3c01027c></div><div class="delish-recipe-description" data-v-57efbdde data-v-3c01027c><p data-v-57efbdde>簡単で失敗しない温泉卵の作り方をご紹介します♪お湯に入れて時間になったら取り出すだけ！お好みのたれをかけてお召し上がりください。【レシピリニューアル】</p></div><!----><div class="delish-recipe-nutrients" data-v-a40f7ad2 data-v-3c01027c><div class="delish-recipe-nutrients-data" data-v-a40f7ad2><ul class="recipe-nutrients" data-v-a40f7ad2><li class="recipe-nutrient" data-v-a40f7ad2><div class="nutrient-icon" data-v-a40f7ad2><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="icon-nutrient" data-v-a40f7ad2 data-v-a40f7ad2><path d="M11.047 20.758C9.563 20.5 8.35 19.283 8.085 17.8a3.66 3.66 0 011.126-3.366 2.498 2.498 0 004.995 0 3.663 3.663 0 011.187 2.695 3.688 3.688 0 01-4.346 3.628m7.678-8.944l-1.01-2.288-3.018-7.754a1.209 1.209 0 00-2.06-.333 12.13 12.13 0 00-2.78 7.068l-.722-.88a1.198 1.198 0 00-1.04-.44c-.397.032-.753.26-.95.608l-2.134 3.767c-1.36 2.397-1.347 5.264.034 7.667 1.34 2.33 3.722 3.74 6.39 3.77h.27c2.597-.029 4.996-1.37 6.42-3.583a8.018 8.018 0 00.6-7.602" data-v-a40f7ad2 data-v-a40f7ad2></path></svg></div><div class="nutrient-name" data-v-a40f7ad2><p data-v-a40f7ad2>カロリー</p></div><div class="nutrient-amount" data-v-a40f7ad2><p data-v-a40f7ad2>93kcal</p></div></li><li class="recipe-nutrient" data-v-a40f7ad2><div class="nutrient-icon" data-v-a40f7ad2><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="icon-nutrient" data-v-a40f7ad2 data-v-a40f7ad2><path d="M5.803 19.011v1.571h12.39c0-.66 0-1.181.039-1.586h-.037v-8.988c0-.962.514-1.877 1.377-2.449a2.264 2.264 0 00.892-2.587A2.25 2.25 0 0018.34 3.42H5.644c-.956.01-1.81.634-2.111 1.552-.318.964.05 2.027.892 2.587.875.581 1.378 1.474 1.378 2.447v9.005zm12.39 3.99H5.803a2.422 2.422 0 01-2.42-2.419c0-.659 0-1.18.038-1.584h-.038v-8.992c0-.212-.208-.372-.297-.432a4.687 4.687 0 01-1.852-5.358 4.676 4.676 0 014.398-3.215h12.627L18.323 1a4.656 4.656 0 014.44 3.216 4.689 4.689 0 01-1.853 5.358c-.069.047-